"GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11tkb57wbs"],"辛辣雞白湯麵",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwja6-HYyNKWAxX5ZvUHHbtXDWEQ3YcHCLEBKAA"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwja6-HYyNKWAxX5ZvUHHbtXDWEQ3IcHCLABKA4",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["下班再去換機油\u0026齒輪油，原本不想去試吃，又不知怎麼亂騎，還是去找停車位，才走過去吃。\n第一次試吃沒點過，我喜歡吃辛口的，那就點一碗辛口拉麵+蛋+雞胸肉+麵、等於490元，以路邊攤價格算貴。\n第一次試吃因為太愛細麵所以加點一份，加麵用另一個碗裝，唐心蛋真的很讓我眼睛發亮，實在太好吃了，味道之濃郁，超讚！辛口拉麵因為是雞胸肉，湯頭有一點腥味，極度很像沾麵，湯頭很濃稠，不太像湯，拉麵裡有碎洋蔥、檸檬片、海苔、青蔥、雞胸肉切片…好久沒吃到沒有玉米的拉麵，基本上口味還不錯，只是我的菜可能是腥味，讓我印象深刻，不太適合我不代表不適合各位朋友唷！喜歡吃雞肉湯頭的朋友還是可以去吃看看唷！",null,[0,94]]]],[],[null,null,9248,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaNlBXWEZBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x176be118379e9882!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDZ6PWXFA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaNlBXWEZBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURaNlBXWEZBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRFo2UFdYbEFFEhNDZ3dJLTVLOHFBWVE4UEhpeEFFGiwKFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRFo2UFdYVkESEkNnc0lscEs4cUFZUTJMSGpKUSISCQAAAAAAAAAAEYKYnjcY4WsXKgswXzJrX3ZOYUFZaw\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwja6-HYyNKWAxX5ZvUHHbtXDWEQoykIsgEoDw"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwjAmujYyNKWAxWUd14EHc-jOuMQ0pMFCFAoBA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwja6-HYyNKWAxX5ZvUHHbtXDWEQ0pMFCJcBKAQ"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURPeTgzd2VBEAE",["0x0:0x176be118379e9882",null,1657782784988308,1657782784988308,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107008111681987149254/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Molly Chang","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdLUt06LPGdll2eXAWn1FCe3vIhlr83cxQrsYrgLeyueT0I2xHDA\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107008111681987149254?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"107008111681987149254",null,145,260,null,[1,6,1],1,["在地嚮導 · 145 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwja6-HYyNKWAxX5ZvUHHbtXDWEQpr8GCLQBKAA"]]]],null,"4 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,[